    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLOVELY HOLIDAY HOME IN ST. HELEN'S BAY RESORTGOLF COURSE ON SITE, BEACH ADJACENTWell-presented own door ground floor apartment of standard construction with double glazed windows throughout and slate roof. The property is located close to the entrance to the development and also convenient to the tennis courts and play area with direct access to Golf course and beach.The property is extremely private with direct access to open green space and landscaped lawns. \n\nBriefy comprising entrance hallway, open plan kitchen/dining/sunroom area, 3 bedrooms (one ensuite), bathroom. St. Helen's is a very popular long established holiday resort with a beautiful beach and quality golf course situated about 10 miles South of Wexford Town in the Sunny South East with several other resorts in the vicinity with Restaurants and other facilities close at hand.\n\nPlease note: The images have been created using Artificial Intelligence (AI) for illustration purposes only. They are not an accurate representation of the property's ariel condition."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.10m x 1.14m & 3.41m 1.91m\nBright open hallway.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.10m x 2.77m\nDouble bedroom space.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.52m x 2.77m\nDouble bedroom space.\n\nBedroom main - 4.8m x 3.57m\nMain bedroom with door to ensuite.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - \nWith wc, whb, shower.\n\nBathroom main - 2.51m x 1.77m\nWith wc whb bath/shower. Tiled walls.\n\nKitchen living - 4.06m x 3.07m & 4.06m x 3.9m\nFeature fitted kitchen, tiled splashback, worktop, open dining, sun room and air con system.\n\nSun room - 3.65m x 3.42m\nViews of green space / lawn, door to patio.\n\n"
      },
